who so clearly had a diagnosis that, you know,

1853
01:18:04.410 --> 01:18:05.703
you could have told a middle schooler about like,

1854
01:18:05.703 --> 01:18:07.080
hey, here's a criteria.

1855
01:18:07.080 --> 01:18:09.093
That person has it, but they didn't have,

1856
01:18:09.093 --> 01:18:12.360
they only had like two from one category instead of three.

1857
01:18:12.360 --> 01:18:13.193
So the person comes back like,

1858
01:18:13.193 --> 01:18:15.450
"I have no idea what's going on."

1859
01:18:15.450 --> 01:18:19.320
Because we are dumbing down the whole system.

1860
01:18:19.320 --> 01:18:21.300
And then the whole understanding

1861
01:18:21.300 --> 01:18:23.850
in the broader community and world around us

1862
01:18:23.850 --> 01:18:25.950
and in the training processes,

1863
01:18:25.950 --> 01:18:28.920
where people will call the DSM a bible.

1864
01:18:28.920 --> 01:18:29.970
Right, I was just gonna say,

1865
01:18:29.970 --> 01:18:33.810
this DSM being considered biblical, and in its edicts-

1866
01:18:33.810 --> 01:18:35.489
Terrible.
Yeah. (laughs)

1867
01:18:35.489 --> 01:18:39.810
It's just, it's terrible, because it leads to,

1868
01:18:39.810 --> 01:18:44.810
it perpetuates an overly rigid form of ignorance

1869
01:18:46.230 --> 01:18:50.310
that is not grounded to what's actually happening in people.

1870
01:18:50.310 --> 01:18:53.010
So if we think, hey, here's this truth,

1871
01:18:53.010 --> 01:18:55.110
that if things happen to us

1872
