1875
01:19:03.690 --> 01:19:05.220
years down the road.

1876
01:19:05.220 --> 01:19:07.980
So very clearly then, the communication

1877
01:19:07.980 --> 01:19:10.980
and the prioritization of different parts of our brain

1878
01:19:10.980 --> 01:19:13.260
informing how we feel and what we decide

1879
01:19:13.260 --> 01:19:15.360
