01:43:19.590 --> 01:43:21.240
Is someone paying attention to me?

2469
01:43:21.240 --> 01:43:22.167
Do you seem interested in me?

2470
01:43:22.167 --> 01:43:23.730
Are you making eye contact with me?

2471
01:43:23.730 --> 01:43:25.350
Do I feel safe with you?

2472
01:43:25.350 --> 01:43:27.150
Do you remember this week what I said last week?

2473
01:43:27.150 --> 01:43:30.120
Like it's just the basics of human,

2474
01:43:30.120 --> 01:43:31.470
you know, of humanness, right?

2475
01:43:31.470 --> 01:43:34.290
In interacting and in building trust.

2476
01:43:34.290 --> 01:43:37.170
And very often, if someone is like that,

2477
01:43:37.170 --> 01:43:39.180
they can establish rapport like that,

2478
01:43:39.180 --> 01:43:42.668
then they're likely to have the undergirding skills

2479
01:43:42.668 --> 01:43:44.100
to be of some help.

2480
01:43:44.100 --> 01:43:46.800
So I think the establishment of rapport

2481
01:43:46.800 --> 01:43:47.880
and the assessment of,

2482
01:43:47.880 --> 01:43:49.560
is this a person I can sit with and trust

2483
01:43:49.560 --> 01:43:50.940
who seems interested in me,

2484
01:43:50.940 --> 01:43:54.060
has benign positive regard for me,

2485
01:43:54.060 --> 01:43:57.150
you know, wants to listen to me, that's,

2486
01:43:57.150 --> 01:43:59.400
we do that, we're over the majority of the hurdles.

2487
01:43:59.400 --> 01:44:00.780
Yeah, that's very empowering,

2488
01:44:00.780 --> 01:44:02.550
because it's not a sense of like, oh,

2489
01:44:02.550 --> 01:44:04.530
you need to find this person who's expert

2490
01:44:04.530 --> 01:44:07.920
in this specific modality and short of that,

2491
01:44:07.920 --> 01:44:08.850
you're out of luck.

2492
01:44:08.850 --> 01:44:10.710
And there's only a few of them.

2493
01:44:10.710 --> 01:44:15.270
The idea that it's trust and somebody who's validating you,

2494
01:44:15.270 --> 01:44:18.300
listening to you, making eye contact with you,

2495
01:44:18.300 --> 01:44:21.150
is like getting you all the way to the 20 yard line

2496
01:44:21.150 --> 01:44:22.620
or whatever on the whole thing.

2497
01:44:22.620 --> 01:44:25.650
Yes, yes, absolutely.

2498
01:44:25.650 --> 01:44:30.060
What is your sense of the appropriateness or efficacy

2499
01:44:30.060 --> 01:44:33.510
of pharmaceutical interventions, SSRIs,

2500
01:44:33.510 --> 01:44:37.320
things like that in the context of trauma?

2501
